# Hawkeye audit — schema/code dumps + reports are LARGE and machine-generated.
# Ignore the generated subdirs explicitly; the scripts + baseline + prompts
# stay tracked so CI and new clones can run the audit out-of-the-box.
.audit/schema/
.audit/code/
.audit/reports/
.audit/repo_migration_versions.txt
.audit/pifh_migration_versions.txt

